    "body": "# UT Dallas Jindal Full-Time MBA Guaranteed Merit Scholarship (SCH-057)\n\n- **Category:** Merit-Based · **Type:** scholarship\n- **Status (2026-10-20):** Automatic with admission\n- **Scope:** utd-mba\n- **Programs:** utd-mba\n- **HK eligible:** yes · **TW eligible:** yes · **International:** yes\n\n## Summary\nEvery admitted FT MBA receives a merit scholarship; recipients pay Texas resident tuition.\n\n## Eligibility\nInternational and out-of-state recipients receive resident tuition rates; GMAT/GRE required for scholarship.\n\n## Amount\nAt least $1,000 (guaranteed) plus resident-rate tuition; cohort distribution 41% $10k–20k, 52% $21k–35k, 7% $35k+/full\n\n## Deadline\nWith admission\n\n## Sources\n- [UTD MBA Cost & Tuition](https://mba.utdallas.edu/tuition-aid/)\n\n_Re-verify on the official page before applying._\n"
